source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Checks for updates against a store, like a client would

Usage: leptoskit codepush check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --store <STORE>        The release store directory; defaults to `releases/` [default: releases]
      --channel <CHANNEL>    The channel to check [default: production]
      --platform <PLATFORM>  Application platform; native releases use a platform-specific channel
      --version <VERSION>    The version a hypothetical client runs [default: 0.1.0]
      --build <BUILD>        The build number a hypothetical client runs [default: 1]
  -h, --help                 Print help
